<mxCell id="c118" value="Other relations: Store -&gt; MonthlyBonusResult; User (KOL) -&gt; MonthlyBonusResult; Store -&gt; Order. There is no direct Order -&gt; CommissionRule FK. Audit details and ruleSnapshot are JSON snapshots, not new relation tables." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="2530" width="3060" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c119" value="Formula: fixed achievement bonus of the highest reached tier + progressive percentage on each exceeded bracket. One 50M tier at 2%, fixed bonus 0: revenue 60M gives (60M - 50M) x 2% = 200,000 VND." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="2610" width="3060" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c120" value="Create uses a Store advisory lock and audit in one transaction. Full update increments version; delete is soft. Configuration/preview do not credit wallets. Settlement is PENDING, then APPROVED, then explicit payout to PAID." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="2690" width="3060" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>